@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Choose an endpoint
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Staff member" as actor
box "Frontend — Keryx Admin application" #E0F2FE
  participant "ApiPage" as page
  participant "ApiStore" as store
  participant "consumerApiExamples" as examples
end box
actor -> page : Choose "GET /v1/status" in the Endpoints list (touch or keyboard)
page -> store : choose("/v1/status")
store -> examples : Example for the endpoint
examples --> store : curl request with kx_live_… and sample 200 OK body
store --> page : Chosen endpoint signal
page --> actor : Item marked aria-current="true"; code-panel shows the example (L2-067)
note over page, examples
  The examples are static and hold only the placeholder key;
  no real key reaches the panel. Code is selectable text that
  scrolls inside the panel on narrow viewports.
end note
@enduml
